@startuml
title EduReserve architecture

top to bottom direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

actor "School administrator" as User

component "Application entry point\n\nEduReserve" as App #FFF2CC
component "User interface and parsing (ui)\n\nUi, Parser, HelpText\nListOptions, ViewOptions" as UI #DAE8FC
component "Commands (command)\n\nCommand and its subclasses\nSortOrder" as Commands #E1D5E7
component "Booking data (tasks)\n\nBookingList, Booking, Task\nVenueCatalog" as Model #D5E8D4
component "Persistence (storage)\n\nStorage" as Storage #F8CECC
component "Input errors (exceptions)\n\nInvalidCommandException" as Errors #F5F5F5
artifact "data/bookings.txt" as File

User --> App : enters console input
App --> UI : creates Ui and passes commands
App --> Storage : loads at startup; saves after commands
App --> Model : holds the loaded BookingList

UI --> Commands : executes commands; uses sorting options
UI --> Model : holds and accesses bookings
Commands ..> UI : uses Parser in book, edit and free
Commands --> Model : reads or changes bookings; queries venues
Storage --> Model : reconstructs and serializes bookings
Storage --> File : reads and writes

UI ..> Errors : throws or catches input errors
Commands ..> Errors : throws command errors

note bottom of Commands
  Booking and editing; cancellation via Ui;
  listing and sorting; finding and viewing;
  calendar; venue availability; attendee counts;
  undo and redo.
end note

legend bottom
  Arrows show dependencies or use, not execution order.
  Supporting types are grouped by their actual packages.
endlegend
@enduml
